WEBVTT

00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:01.703
A ka parazite te keqinj, shpirtezi

00:09:01.703 --> 00:09:03.659
qe po ndikojne ne sjelljen tone

00:09:03.659 --> 00:09:05.234
pa e ditur ne,

00:09:05.234 --> 00:09:08.053
pervec NSA?

00:09:08.053 --> 00:09:09.360
Nese ka ndonje -

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.326
(Te qeshura) (Duartrokitje)

00:09:13.326 --> 00:09:15.648
Kam nje pike te kuqe 
ne balle tani, apo jo?

00:09:15.648 --> 00:09:18.175
(Te qeshura)

00:09:18.175 --> 00:09:21.129
Nese ka ndonje, ja ku eshte nje kandidat
i mundshem per ta.

00:09:21.129 --> 00:09:24.407
Kjo eshte Toxoplasma gondii 
ose shkurt, Tokso,

00:09:24.407 --> 00:09:25.996
per shkak te natyres tmerruese

00:09:25.996 --> 00:09:28.206
gjithmone ka nevoje 
per nje nofke te lezetshme.

00:09:28.206 --> 00:09:30.488
Tokso infekton gjitaret,